sequenceDiagram
  participant Client
  participant API as Future API
  participant Policy as Auth and policy gate
  participant Runtime as Model runtime
  participant Model as Approved model artifact
  participant Obs as Redacted observability
  Client->>API: Request (future contract)
  API->>Policy: Authenticate, validate, apply limits
  Policy->>Runtime: Authorized context and model version
  Runtime->>Model: Bounded inference
  Model-->>Runtime: Candidate output
  Runtime->>Policy: Validate output and safety
  Policy-->>API: Response or controlled refusal
  API-->>Client: Versioned response
  API->>Obs: Minimal, redacted event
